		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Re: MD9600 Hotspot Mode using DVSwitch (MMDVM_Bridge) in debian 10 ?]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=3861&amp;p=30085#p30085"><![CDATA[
Hotspot needs to be enabled in the Options in the firmware, otherwise the Com port will communicate with the MMDVMHost serial protocol<br><br>Reading the MMDVM Bridge docs e.g. <a href="https://www.qsl.net/kb9mwr/projects/dv/multi/MMDVM_Bridge.pdf" class="postlink">https://www.qsl.net/kb9mwr/projects/dv/ ... Bridge.pdf</a><br><br>It says "All Ports are UDP"<br><br>i.e this software is a network connectivity application<br><br>You need to run MMDVMHost to commicate with the MD9600 acting as a MMDVM modem.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Wed Mar 13, 2024 6:23 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
